SUMMARY:Music and Movement (birth to 6 years old)
LOCATION:7755 Bayview Avenue\, Thornhill\, ON L3T 4P1
DESCRIPTION:This program invites you and your child(ren) to enjoy music and
  movement together. We’ll sing songs\, play with instruments and materia
 ls that help support healthy development while connecting with other famil
 ies and educators.\n\nDrop-in\n\nCentre: EarlyON Thornhill Centre\n\nSourc
