DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T111500
SUMMARY:Exploring STEAM (12 months to 6 years old)
LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This program invites you and your child(ren) to explore STEAM (
 science\, technology\, engineering\, art\, and math) ideas. Children will 
 investigate\, play\, communicate\, and experiment\, making learning a fun 
 and interactive experience. Join us to discover the exciting world of STEA
 M and watch your child’s curiosity and creativity grow! It’s a great w
 ay to connect with other families and educators.\n\n**Please bring indoor 
 shoes (or socks) for the program room.**\n\nDrop-in\n\nCentre: EarlyON Mar
 kham Centre\n\nSource: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/c
 alendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:d398a8d6f2e97a6e@earlyon-cal
DTSTAMP:20260922T121907Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T094500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260915T110000
SUMMARY:Creative Chefs (30 months to 6 years old)
LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This program invites you and your child(ren) to participate in 
 fun and interactive early learning experiences while preparing healthy and
  nutritious food. Resources on healthy eating and nutrition will be made a
 vailable. It’s a great way to connect with other families and educators.
 \n\n**This 3-session VIRTUAL Program will take place via Zoom. The program
  link and ingredient list will be provided in advance of each session.**\n
 \nPre-registration required\, Virtual\n\nCentre: EarlyON Markham Centre\n\
 nSource: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
