BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:4aa4404f47c55681@earlyon-cal
DTSTAMP:20260922T121907Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260916T153000
SUMMARY:Triple P® Primary Care (birth to 6 years old)
LOCATION:7755 Bayview Avenue\, Thornhill\, ON L3T 4P1
DESCRIPTION:This program offers parents or caregivers one to one support to
  help develop a parenting plan to handle specific issues (e.g. tantrums\, 
 fighting\, going shopping) and develop skills (e.g. eating independently\,
  toilet training\, staying in bed at night). You will meet with a Triple P
 ® Provider about four times. Each session takes between 15 - 30 minutes a
 nd you will be given tip sheets to take home to remind you of the strategi
 es you have chosen.\n\nSpeech and Language consultation\n\nCentre: EarlyON
  Thornhill Centre\n\nSource: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/ear
 lyon/calendar
URL:https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
