LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This program invites you to strengthen your connection with you
 r baby through soothing movement\, nurturing touch\, and mindful relaxatio
 n. This 4-week Parent-Baby Yoga series is designed for infants 4 to 12 mon
 ths and their caregivers. This class can support physical development\, be
 tter sleep\, digestion\, and emotional well-being while offering parents a
  chance to rejuvenate\, reduce stress\, and build community. It's a great 
 way to connect with other families and educators.\n\n**Please bring a mat\
 , and indoor shoes (or socks) for the program room.**\n\nPre-registration 
