SUMMARY:Triple P® Seminar: Raising Resilient Children (birth to 6 years ol
 d)
LOCATION:3990 14th Avenue\, Markham\, ON L3R 0B2
DESCRIPTION:This small group seminar is for parents and caregivers who want
  to help their child(ren) manage their emotions\, so they cope well with d
 isappointment and stressful situations. Learn strategies that will allow c
 hildren to recognize positive and negative emotions\, and deal with them i
 n healthy ways. It’s a great way to connect with other families and educ
 ators.\n\n**Triple P VIRTUAL Seminar 3. Link to join will be provided in a
 dvance.**\n*Note: If you register AFTER October 26\, please email earlyonm
 arkham@familydaycare.com to request the link to join.*\n\nOther Triple P S
 eminars this month:\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 1 (The Power of Positivie 
 Parenting): Tues. October 27\, 9-10:30am\n* Triple P Virtual Seminar 2 (Ra
 ising Confident\, Competent Children): Wed. October 28\, 9-10:30am\n\nPre-
 registration required\, Virtual\n\nCentre: EarlyON Markham Centre\n\nSourc
 e: https://www.missioninc.com/cso/york/en-ca/earlyon/calendar
